(6797538, 1021579, 112539, '<td valign="top">The reason I didn''t vote higher on this photo is because it looked like you just tried to make a story from a child that was handy rather than really going out and finding something abandoned. If the child had looked more abandoned in a more rustic abandoned type setting I could have gone for it. Not a bad photo but this is a themed challenge.</td>', 'The reason I didn''t vote higher on this photo is because it looked like you just tried to make a story from a child that was handy rather than really going out and finding something abandoned. If the child had looked more abandoned in a more rustic abandoned type setting I could have gone for it. Not a bad photo but this is a themed challenge.', '2012-06-18 11:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797540, 1021635, 101668, '<td valign="top">A nice green summer feel to this</td>', 'A nice green summer feel to this', '2012-06-18 11:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797543, 1021440, 112539, '<td valign="top">Didn''t really see the theme abandoned so couldn''t give it a higher score. Just looked like cats on a chair. The purpose of DP challenge in my mind is to challenge us to go out and really find the best representation of the theme.</td>', 'Didn''t really see the theme abandoned so couldn''t give it a higher score. Just looked like cats on a chair. The purpose of DP challenge in my mind is to challenge us to go out and really find the best representation of the theme.', '2012-06-18 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
