(6797602, 1021628, 138253, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks old and abandoned and it''s a true testament to the architect/builders that it''s in such good shape after so many years.<br/> <br/>This doesn''t have the same gritty feel as many of the other entries i''ve seen, hopefully your score mimics the building and holds it''s own for this challenge.<br/>6/10</td>', 'Definitely looks old and abandoned and it''s a true testament to the architect/builders that it''s in such good shape after so many years. This doesn''t have the same gritty feel as many of the other entries i''ve seen, hopefully your score mimics the building and holds it''s own for this challenge.6/10', '2012-06-18 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797603, 1021564, 138253, '<td valign="top">I like the red tones in this, it gives it a rusted feeling despite being wooden.<br/>This looks like the perfect place to have an adventure when you''re 6 years old!</td>', 'I like the red tones in this, it gives it a rusted feeling despite being wooden.This looks like the perfect place to have an adventure when you''re 6 years old!', '2012-06-18 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797612, 1021622, 138253, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this image is far too pretty and new for this challenge with your focal point not actually being what you describe in your title.<br/>in order for this topic to work, i''d have to have an image of someone actually discarding the napkin to accept it...even then it''s discarded, and i don''t consider discarded and abandoned to be on fully equal footing in terms of usage.<br/>To me, abandoned needs to have some future, current, or at least recent, significant value to the person leaving it. A napkin you used to blow your nose does not have the same value as the house you lived in but had to leave behind, or the car you drove to work in daily; or even the child you carried for 9 months but which you cannot provide a suitable life for.<br/>in my opinion, this image DNMC for the above stated reason.</td>', 'Sorry, this image is far too pretty and new for this challenge with your focal point not actually being what you describe in your title.in order for this topic to work, i''d have to have an image of someone actually discarding the napkin to accept it...even then it''s discarded, and i don''t consider discarded and abandoned to be on fully equal footing in terms of usage.To me, abandoned needs to have some future, current, or at least recent, significant value to the person leaving it. A napkin you used to blow your nose does not have the same value as the house you lived in but had to leave behind, or the car you drove to work in daily; or even the child you carried for 9 months but which you cannot provide a suitable life for.in my opinion, this image DNMC for the above stated reason.', '2012-06-18 13:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797620, 1021634, 138253, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t strike me as abandoned. there''s apparent plant growth here, which means the daisy could have grown here, and despite the fact it was destroyed, it wasn''t left to it''s own devices in order to try to make a life for itself.</td>', 'This image doesn''t strike me as abandoned. there''s apparent plant growth here, which means the daisy could have grown here, and despite the fact it was destroyed, it wasn''t left to it''s own devices in order to try to make a life for itself.', '2012-06-18 13:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797621, 1021612, 138253, '<td valign="top">that''s definitely abandoned.<br/>it''s a bit dark in the upper left corner, but i doubt it would give any drastic change to the image if it had been fully lit.<br/>i quite like this image for the challenge, i hope to see it do well</td>', 'that''s definitely abandoned.it''s a bit dark in the upper left corner, but i doubt it would give any drastic change to the image if it had been fully lit.i quite like this image for the challenge, i hope to see it do well', '2012-06-18 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797622, 1021565, 138253, '<td valign="top">aww, poor shell. this is definitely a serious case of abandonment. lets hope another hermit crab happens along to adopt the old shell</td>', 'aww, poor shell. this is definitely a serious case of abandonment. lets hope another hermit crab happens along to adopt the old shell', '2012-06-18 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797625, 1021374, 83901, '<td valign="top">great location! However a little more contrast would make it even better.</td>', 'great location! However a little more contrast would make it even better.', '2012-06-18 13:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797634, 1021515, 142473, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but the image itself is off to me.  Yes it shows the concept with the aid of the title, but I think it should have been done in a B&amp;W.  I get stuck in the colors.  Red, brown, pink, blue.  Very off putting.  However a B&amp;W conversion could have potentially aided this image by bringing focus on the web, not the colors of the bikes.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but the image itself is off to me.  Yes it shows the concept with the aid of the title, but I think it should have been done in a B&W.  I get stuck in the colors.  Red, brown, pink, blue.  Very off putting.  However a B&W conversion could have potentially aided this image by bringing focus on the web, not the colors of the bikes.', '2012-06-18 14:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797636, 1021588, 142473, '<td valign="top">Looks staged to me.  Not sure what the concept really is here... what tea party?  Why is it the last one, and why did they upturn the pot before they left?</td>', 'Looks staged to me.  Not sure what the concept really is here... what tea party?  Why is it the last one, and why did they upturn the pot before they left?', '2012-06-18 14:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6797638, 1021456, 142473, '<td valign="top">A nice subject, but a very uninteresting POV.  Get down, get creative, get close or get far.  As for processing, overall pleasant, but I think it could use some extra contrast to bring out the subjects.  Since they are darker than the surroundings, it makes it more challenging to bring your attention in to them.</td>', 'A nice subject, but a very uninteresting POV.  Get down, get creative, get close or get far.  As for processing, overall pleasant, but I think it could use some extra contrast to bring out the subjects.  Since they are darker than the surroundings, it makes it more challenging to bring your attention in to them.', '2012-06-18 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
