(6797658, 1021452, 138253, '<td valign="top">it looks to be moreso ''discarded'', and as i see it, discarded differs from abandoned in that discarded items contain no past, present or future value. this looks to be a newspaper in a plastic bag which holds no substantial value.<br/>and while it may be on a set of steps in a state of minor disrepair, it does not constitute an overall image of abandoned to me.</td>', 'it looks to be moreso ''discarded'', and as i see it, discarded differs from abandoned in that discarded items contain no past, present or future value. this looks to be a newspaper in a plastic bag which holds no substantial value.and while it may be on a set of steps in a state of minor disrepair, it does not constitute an overall image of abandoned to me.', '2012-06-18 15:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
