(6797696, 1021195, 124190, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this is a college student walking out of a completely boggled attempt of a final exam on Hegel due to his convoluted, intensely difficult and challenging ideologies?  Or maybe a free spirit rejecting the repressed analysis of an indulgent and extremely boring philosophy teacher......maybe the professor leaving the classroom after a dizzying and frustrating semester dealing with a vapid group of freshman?   Maybe someone rejecting the ideologies of communism   Then again it could be someone escaping the grip of communism.......clearly an abandonment.    10 How''s that for some analytical attempts to understand of this photo. LOL.</td>', 'Perhaps this is a college student walking out of a completely boggled attempt of a final exam on Hegel due to his convoluted, intensely difficult and challenging ideologies?  Or maybe a free spirit rejecting the repressed analysis of an indulgent and extremely boring philosophy teacher......maybe the professor leaving the classroom after a dizzying and frustrating semester dealing with a vapid group of freshman?   Maybe someone rejecting the ideologies of communism   Then again it could be someone escaping the grip of communism.......clearly an abandonment.    10 How''s that for some analytical attempts to understand of this photo. LOL.', '2012-06-18 16:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
