(6798113, 1021636, 138253, '<td valign="top">shallow DoF would be better emphasized if you got a good look at the hatchling''s face instead of just the mouth a pile of what i''m assuming is feathers.<br/>hopefully the mother didn''t actually abandon the next if she caught a strange scene around the nest</td>', 'shallow DoF would be better emphasized if you got a good look at the hatchling''s face instead of just the mouth a pile of what i''m assuming is feathers.hopefully the mother didn''t actually abandon the next if she caught a strange scene around the nest', '2012-06-19 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798114, 1021541, 138253, '<td valign="top">based on your title, i''m going to have to say this should be dq''d.<br/>the image has to be taken by you, after the challenge was announced. images taken before this cannot be used, so since was ''long ago'' in another galaxy, this would definitely be outside the 1 week period in which the challenge was announced and accepting entries. ;-)</td>', 'based on your title, i''m going to have to say this should be dq''d.the image has to be taken by you, after the challenge was announced. images taken before this cannot be used, so since was ''long ago'' in another galaxy, this would definitely be outside the 1 week period in which the challenge was announced and accepting entries. ;-)', '2012-06-19 16:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798115, 1021535, 138253, '<td valign="top">if the house was abandoned, can they really be burglars? ;)<br/>i''d comment about blurriness/focus, but i have a feeling this is a rhetoric i''ve said on your images before many times. i have a sneaking suspicion that this will hang in the posthumous gallery with a red portrait icon.</td>', 'if the house was abandoned, can they really be burglars? ;)i''d comment about blurriness/focus, but i have a feeling this is a rhetoric i''ve said on your images before many times. i have a sneaking suspicion that this will hang in the posthumous gallery with a red portrait icon.', '2012-06-19 16:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798118, 1021546, 138253, '<td valign="top">doesn''t really look abandoned to me.<br/>not in use, sure, but the scene is still very clean and lacking a sense of duration of abandonment. for all the viewer knows, you were sitting here before you took the picture, and then you sat back down. if so, the chair wasn''t actually abandoned, just temporarily vacated.<br/>if you''re saying that someone abandoned you, there is no other presence in this picture, looking wistfully into the distance waiting for the person to return.</td>', 'doesn''t really look abandoned to me.not in use, sure, but the scene is still very clean and lacking a sense of duration of abandonment. for all the viewer knows, you were sitting here before you took the picture, and then you sat back down. if so, the chair wasn''t actually abandoned, just temporarily vacated.if you''re saying that someone abandoned you, there is no other presence in this picture, looking wistfully into the distance waiting for the person to return.', '2012-06-19 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798120, 1021374, 138253, '<td valign="top">definitely gives the feeling of an outdated piece of equipment that has been left behind for "bigger and better". For all we know, this whole building was the old firehouse and is as abandoned as the truck it still houses.<br/>biggest drawback for the abandoned theme is the wood in the lower left corner - it looks too ''new'' to have been abandoned with the building in the state it''s in - it looks like it''s about to receive an overhaul to the premesis.<br/>still, a great image for the building/truck in feeling their disrepair/abandonment</td>', 'definitely gives the feeling of an outdated piece of equipment that has been left behind for "bigger and better". For all we know, this whole building was the old firehouse and is as abandoned as the truck it still houses.biggest drawback for the abandoned theme is the wood in the lower left corner - it looks too ''new'' to have been abandoned with the building in the state it''s in - it looks like it''s about to receive an overhaul to the premesis.still, a great image for the building/truck in feeling their disrepair/abandonment', '2012-06-19 16:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798122, 1021460, 138253, '<td valign="top">overall not the greatest presentation of an abandoned house as you can barely see the boarded up window and the (i''m guessing fencing?) is obscuring much of the rest of the scene including what looks to be an open door.<br/>could equally be a house that does not have owners that are capable/willing of keeping it ''pretty'', but have not yet abandoned it.</td>', 'overall not the greatest presentation of an abandoned house as you can barely see the boarded up window and the (i''m guessing fencing?) is obscuring much of the rest of the scene including what looks to be an open door.could equally be a house that does not have owners that are capable/willing of keeping it ''pretty'', but have not yet abandoned it.', '2012-06-19 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798123, 1021202, 138253, '<td valign="top">definitely gives the vibe of a crazy lady or a jilted lover, and the building sets a grim tone, but i am trying to comprehend why she would be dressed up and sitting on a pile of photos in such a ratty old building.<br/>still, decent entry. 6/10</td>', 'definitely gives the vibe of a crazy lady or a jilted lover, and the building sets a grim tone, but i am trying to comprehend why she would be dressed up and sitting on a pile of photos in such a ratty old building.still, decent entry. 6/10', '2012-06-19 16:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798124, 1021464, 138253, '<td valign="top">definitely gives the abandoned feeling.<br/>having more than one side of the building in frame could help with the perspective (and possibly your score if this is in the mid 4''s as i''m guessing - especially after reading the scores thread).<br/>overgrown bushes are a nice touch, but feel too cramped on top of your subject.</td>', 'definitely gives the abandoned feeling.having more than one side of the building in frame could help with the perspective (and possibly your score if this is in the mid 4''s as i''m guessing - especially after reading the scores thread).overgrown bushes are a nice touch, but feel too cramped on top of your subject.', '2012-06-19 16:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798125, 1021249, 138253, '<td valign="top">straight-on building shots feel very one dimensional. taking the perspective to include two sides can help if this is scoring low.<br/>while it certain looks dumpy enough, it''s just not that interesting.</td>', 'straight-on building shots feel very one dimensional. taking the perspective to include two sides can help if this is scoring low.while it certain looks dumpy enough, it''s just not that interesting.', '2012-06-19 16:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
