(6798775, 1021641, 138253, '<td valign="top">i don''t get the feeling that i''m sure you''re trying to convey here. to me this is an empty beach scene with a ghosted out blur (assuming it''s meant to represent someone who left) but there is no indication that they abandoned you or their life in general.<br/>a person looking towards the ocean, holding a memento of the departed, or a flower on the ground and walking away with the head down could convey the sense of loss of the person, but i do not feel that loss based on the scene you present here.</td>', 'i don''t get the feeling that i''m sure you''re trying to convey here. to me this is an empty beach scene with a ghosted out blur (assuming it''s meant to represent someone who left) but there is no indication that they abandoned you or their life in general.a person looking towards the ocean, holding a memento of the departed, or a flower on the ground and walking away with the head down could convey the sense of loss of the person, but i do not feel that loss based on the scene you present here.', '2012-06-20 13:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6798909, 1021443, 119771, '<td valign="top">c</td>', 'c', '2012-06-20 16:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799062, 1021350, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like this.. Would''ve preferred a deeper DOF.</td>', 'I like this.. Would''ve preferred a deeper DOF.', '2012-06-21 02:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799080, 1021460, 113156, '<td valign="top">Great lines everywhere, shot by a keen eye for sure.</td>', 'Great lines everywhere, shot by a keen eye for sure.', '2012-06-21 04:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799081, 1021642, 113156, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and composition in this one.</td>', 'Love the processing and composition in this one.', '2012-06-21 04:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799187, 1021525, 138253, '<td valign="top">high contrast B&amp;W on the brick may "add" age, but the overall scene here is dominated by the high rise building. doesn''t feel abandoned from this perspective.</td>', 'high contrast B&W on the brick may "add" age, but the overall scene here is dominated by the high rise building. doesn''t feel abandoned from this perspective.', '2012-06-21 11:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799189, 1021273, 138253, '<td valign="top">sorry, not feeling the abandonment here. narrow DoF on a model with nothing else in focus bring the focus to her and not to the fact she was left behind. there is literally nothing else but her to this picture, that''s more contrary to the theme than anything. having her "abandoned in a sea of people" where nobody is paying any attention to her, or having more clearly defined environmental details could bring more emphasis to her apparent plight in my opinion.</td>', 'sorry, not feeling the abandonment here. narrow DoF on a model with nothing else in focus bring the focus to her and not to the fact she was left behind. there is literally nothing else but her to this picture, that''s more contrary to the theme than anything. having her "abandoned in a sea of people" where nobody is paying any attention to her, or having more clearly defined environmental details could bring more emphasis to her apparent plight in my opinion.', '2012-06-21 11:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799190, 1020741, 138253, '<td valign="top">poor little guy...<br/>as gritty and unappealing a scene as you present here, you have done a great job of capturing the abandonment of childish attachments here.</td>', 'poor little guy...as gritty and unappealing a scene as you present here, you have done a great job of capturing the abandonment of childish attachments here.', '2012-06-21 11:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799191, 1021643, 138253, '<td valign="top">given the proximity to houses i find this to be more of a pile of tires instead of something abandoned. i''m willing to bet that the residents of those houses pay attention to make sure nothing bad is happening around that pile as it would potentially impact their safety. <br/>doesn''t have the same feeling of abandonment in my opinion.</td>', 'given the proximity to houses i find this to be more of a pile of tires instead of something abandoned. i''m willing to bet that the residents of those houses pay attention to make sure nothing bad is happening around that pile as it would potentially impact their safety. doesn''t have the same feeling of abandonment in my opinion.', '2012-06-21 11:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799193, 1021633, 138253, '<td valign="top">one of the best ''abandoned person'' images i''ve seen so far - the location, body language and minimal covering add to the fact this person seemingly has nothing in her life. the one eye showing on the tattoo looks like a young animal pleading for help, which only adds to this as it gives me a feeling that deep down she''s crying for help but on the surface only a fraction of that would show through, and would quickly be covered by a facade.<br/>i''d hope to see this in the top 10 but fear it may be lost on many looking for pretty pictures.</td>', 'one of the best ''abandoned person'' images i''ve seen so far - the location, body language and minimal covering add to the fact this person seemingly has nothing in her life. the one eye showing on the tattoo looks like a young animal pleading for help, which only adds to this as it gives me a feeling that deep down she''s crying for help but on the surface only a fraction of that would show through, and would quickly be covered by a facade.i''d hope to see this in the top 10 but fear it may be lost on many looking for pretty pictures.', '2012-06-21 11:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799196, 1021259, 138253, '<td valign="top">not just once, but two times this has been abandoned as there are no signs of residence from those who built the nest.</td>', 'not just once, but two times this has been abandoned as there are no signs of residence from those who built the nest.', '2012-06-21 11:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799197, 1021579, 138253, '<td valign="top">great focus here on the little girl. the enveloping shadows are a nice touch to the overall feel here. positioning is spot-on, i expect this to place well.</td>', 'great focus here on the little girl. the enveloping shadows are a nice touch to the overall feel here. positioning is spot-on, i expect this to place well.', '2012-06-21 11:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799198, 1021422, 138253, '<td valign="top">poor little guy, he almost got lost in this photo as well.</td>', 'poor little guy, he almost got lost in this photo as well.', '2012-06-21 11:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799201, 1021545, 138253, '<td valign="top">not a big fan of the framing on this, though i''m probably in the minority. i''d like to have seen this slightly closer with a wider angle lens.<br/>the foreground looks too clean and polished to fit in with the boarded up building.</td>', 'not a big fan of the framing on this, though i''m probably in the minority. i''d like to have seen this slightly closer with a wider angle lens.the foreground looks too clean and polished to fit in with the boarded up building.', '2012-06-21 11:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799202, 1021637, 138253, '<td valign="top">cute, but overall "snap shot"-y and lacking in real feelings of abandonment</td>', 'cute, but overall "snap shot"-y and lacking in real feelings of abandonment', '2012-06-21 11:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799203, 1021581, 138253, '<td valign="top">interesting view and great comment on society''s abandonment of previous staples in whole.</td>', 'interesting view and great comment on society''s abandonment of previous staples in whole.', '2012-06-21 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799204, 1021461, 138253, '<td valign="top">great depth and tone to this image. i can see the horror movie bad guy lurking in the background and the blonde cheerleader peeking her head out to see if things are safe to make a run for it.</td>', 'great depth and tone to this image. i can see the horror movie bad guy lurking in the background and the blonde cheerleader peeking her head out to see if things are safe to make a run for it.', '2012-06-21 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799205, 1021440, 138253, '<td valign="top">not feeling the abandonment here. also the cats feel very flat and one dimensional.</td>', 'not feeling the abandonment here. also the cats feel very flat and one dimensional.', '2012-06-21 11:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799221, 1021543, 30669, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2012-06-21 12:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
