(6799314, 1021364, 138253, '<td valign="top">feel this image needs more of a sense of environment. can''t exactly make out where this is supposed to be, and even then the whole image is a little too fuzzy - the bear, which is your focal point, is only partially in focus. detracts some from the image</td>', 'feel this image needs more of a sense of environment. can''t exactly make out where this is supposed to be, and even then the whole image is a little too fuzzy - the bear, which is your focal point, is only partially in focus. detracts some from the image', '2012-06-21 14:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799317, 1021456, 138253, '<td valign="top">little too much here. the truck and shed are great, the overgrown field is a nice add, but too many trees and too much superflous sky. <br/>a different angle (line between you/truck/shed) with the focus drawn into a more compressed image would be good. there''s just too much detail on unimportant aspects of this image.</td>', 'little too much here. the truck and shed are great, the overgrown field is a nice add, but too many trees and too much superflous sky. a different angle (line between you/truck/shed) with the focus drawn into a more compressed image would be good. there''s just too much detail on unimportant aspects of this image.', '2012-06-21 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799319, 1021409, 138253, '<td valign="top">abandoned looking but nothing incredibly interesting going on here to make me want to continue looking past voting/commenting</td>', 'abandoned looking but nothing incredibly interesting going on here to make me want to continue looking past voting/commenting', '2012-06-21 14:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799320, 1021298, 138253, '<td valign="top">not overly interesting.<br/>i like the detail on the chain where its in focus though</td>', 'not overly interesting.i like the detail on the chain where its in focus though', '2012-06-21 15:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799325, 1021520, 138253, '<td valign="top">i like the comparative scene between the buildings and mountains, and it''s definitely on theme. not as big a fan of the B&amp;W as is, i''d have to compare to color to know for sure</td>', 'i like the comparative scene between the buildings and mountains, and it''s definitely on theme. not as big a fan of the B&W as is, i''d have to compare to color to know for sure', '2012-06-21 15:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799326, 1021431, 138253, '<td valign="top">old, sure, but i don''t get the feeling of abandoned from this - the windows look in decent shape and the door appears solidly functional.<br/>this house certainly has a lot of character.</td>', 'old, sure, but i don''t get the feeling of abandoned from this - the windows look in decent shape and the door appears solidly functional.this house certainly has a lot of character.', '2012-06-21 15:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799328, 1021562, 138253, '<td valign="top">interesting HDR on the brick - i like it.<br/>the post in front is too distracting, even if you mean it to add to the abandoned aspect - it''s too much.<br/>the wood on the ground with old looking brick/wood buildings would''ve sufficed, even if you had to change your perspective and get lower to the ground to include some of these elements.<br/>still a 5/10 from me tho</td>', 'interesting HDR on the brick - i like it.the post in front is too distracting, even if you mean it to add to the abandoned aspect - it''s too much.the wood on the ground with old looking brick/wood buildings would''ve sufficed, even if you had to change your perspective and get lower to the ground to include some of these elements.still a 5/10 from me tho', '2012-06-21 15:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799330, 1021524, 138253, '<td valign="top">stark contrast between the locomotive and the blue skies/intact railroad building.<br/>interesting find for the train</td>', 'stark contrast between the locomotive and the blue skies/intact railroad building.interesting find for the train', '2012-06-21 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799332, 1021534, 138253, '<td valign="top">definitely fits the theme, but the OoF foreground plants take away from this in my opinion.<br/>i like the boat by the vertical logs and the power plant/factory in the background - it creates a nice scene</td>', 'definitely fits the theme, but the OoF foreground plants take away from this in my opinion.i like the boat by the vertical logs and the power plant/factory in the background - it creates a nice scene', '2012-06-21 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799334, 1020978, 138253, '<td valign="top">very ''pretty'' scene, i imagine this is going to score well into the 6''s.<br/>the dock has definitely seen it''s better days. good find.</td>', 'very ''pretty'' scene, i imagine this is going to score well into the 6''s.the dock has definitely seen it''s better days. good find.', '2012-06-21 15:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799337, 1021599, 138253, '<td valign="top">elephants always look so sad, it''s like they know what we (as a species) did to them.<br/>great use of avoiding superflous environment in this picture.</td>', 'elephants always look so sad, it''s like they know what we (as a species) did to them.great use of avoiding superflous environment in this picture.', '2012-06-21 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799339, 1021632, 138253, '<td valign="top">WAY too much foreground for my taste - this has been happening in a lot of entries in this challenge, seemingly to get the shot of an old building.<br/>getting closer and using a wider angle lens would''ve been great, or even just ''cutting the grass'' before you resize, to keep the majority of the photo (2/3 or so, instead of the existing image at 1/3) focused on the building - your focus.</td>', 'WAY too much foreground for my taste - this has been happening in a lot of entries in this challenge, seemingly to get the shot of an old building.getting closer and using a wider angle lens would''ve been great, or even just ''cutting the grass'' before you resize, to keep the majority of the photo (2/3 or so, instead of the existing image at 1/3) focused on the building - your focus.', '2012-06-21 15:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799341, 1021381, 138253, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, but this doesn''t really seem abandoned to me.<br/>dilapadated, sure, but this seems to be a well-kept area that''s still in use, and the truck gives no reason to believe it didn''t make it''s way there the same day as this shot or that it couldn''t leave that spot under it''s own power.<br/>i like the architecture here, great contrast on the bricks.</td>', 'interesting photo, but this doesn''t really seem abandoned to me.dilapadated, sure, but this seems to be a well-kept area that''s still in use, and the truck gives no reason to believe it didn''t make it''s way there the same day as this shot or that it couldn''t leave that spot under it''s own power.i like the architecture here, great contrast on the bricks.', '2012-06-21 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799342, 1021350, 138253, '<td valign="top">not getting the abandoned feeling here. sorry.<br/>i''m guessing this image is intended as a visual commentary on the first step of quitting smoking, but that''s not abandonment to me, it''s freedom.</td>', 'not getting the abandoned feeling here. sorry.i''m guessing this image is intended as a visual commentary on the first step of quitting smoking, but that''s not abandonment to me, it''s freedom.', '2012-06-21 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799345, 1021592, 138253, '<td valign="top">framing/positioning is what makes or breaks images in a challenge like this. i feel there is a bit too much superfluous environment in this shot. changing perspective and keeping excess items to a minimum would help</td>', 'framing/positioning is what makes or breaks images in a challenge like this. i feel there is a bit too much superfluous environment in this shot. changing perspective and keeping excess items to a minimum would help', '2012-06-21 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6799346, 1021481, 138253, '<td valign="top">just feels too much like a snapshot.<br/>yes they''re abandoned and if they ever caught fire there''s a lot of fuel to make it into a big mess, but the focus here seems mroe about the area with some tires than on making the tires the focus.</td>', 'just feels too much like a snapshot.yes they''re abandoned and if they ever caught fire there''s a lot of fuel to make it into a big mess, but the focus here seems mroe about the area with some tires than on making the tires the focus.', '2012-06-21 15:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
