(6799361, 1021515, 138253, '<td valign="top">Sad how many kids lose out on the simple joys of riding their bike lately. The sense of freedom it affords kids is priceless, shame to see this lost.</td>', 'Sad how many kids lose out on the simple joys of riding their bike lately. The sense of freedom it affords kids is priceless, shame to see this lost.', '2012-06-21 16:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
