(6800388, 1021259, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice poison ivy. How are you feeling?  I do like the way you framed the rusty old box with the bright fresh green leaves. And the abandoned bird''s nest is a nice touch too.</td>', 'Nice poison ivy. How are you feeling?  I do like the way you framed the rusty old box with the bright fresh green leaves. And the abandoned bird''s nest is a nice touch too.', '2012-06-22 17:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6800564, 1021378, 102315, '<td valign="top">This is the first image that popped up for me and let me say at first I was like what the hell is that then I realized what I was looking at and it really appealed to the H R Giger / H P Lovecraft macabre side of me. I think it''s an awesome photo. Only thing I would say throws it off just a little is the space to the right. Wish it would have been cropped differently. Interesting image regardless though! high marks</td>', 'This is the first image that popped up for me and let me say at first I was like what the hell is that then I realized what I was looking at and it really appealed to the H R Giger / H P Lovecraft macabre side of me. I think it''s an awesome photo. Only thing I would say throws it off just a little is the space to the right. Wish it would have been cropped differently. Interesting image regardless though! high marks', '2012-06-22 22:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
