(6801694, 1021091, 142473, '<td valign="top">I''ll offer up a differing view:  Looks like an overworked snapshot.  The composition is very unimaginative, and while the sky is quite interesting, I find myself looking at it and the ground more than the actual subject.<br/> <br/>While the subject is a great example of an abandoned item, to me, the image derives it''s interest mainly from the color map, not much more.  Not trying to make enemies, just trying to offer up a different sentiment.  I think this site needs more of that.</td>', 'I''ll offer up a differing view:  Looks like an overworked snapshot.  The composition is very unimaginative, and while the sky is quite interesting, I find myself looking at it and the ground more than the actual subject. While the subject is a great example of an abandoned item, to me, the image derives it''s interest mainly from the color map, not much more.  Not trying to make enemies, just trying to offer up a different sentiment.  I think this site needs more of that.', '2012-06-25 12:23:46.000000', NULL, 0),
