(6801719, 1021525, 142473, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RyanWareham:</b></div><hr/><i> high contrast B&amp;W on the brick may "add" age, but the overall scene here is dominated by the high rise building. doesn''t feel abandoned from this perspective. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>My point was not to make the entire image feel abandoned, but to show the contrasts of inner cities.  You may have a totally abandoned building next to a shiny new skyrise.  The challenge was not to make an image feel abandoned, it was just a point of origin for a mind to take-off from.  Open your mind!</td>', 'Originally posted by RyanWareham: high contrast B&W on the brick may "add" age, but the overall scene here is dominated by the high rise building. doesn''t feel abandoned from this perspective.  My point was not to make the entire image feel abandoned, but to show the contrasts of inner cities.  You may have a totally abandoned building next to a shiny new skyrise.  The challenge was not to make an image feel abandoned, it was just a point of origin for a mind to take-off from.  Open your mind!', '2012-06-25 12:47:57.000000', NULL, 0),
