(6801733, 1021452, 138253, '<td valign="top">sorry for being the voice of the nay-sayers in this case. :(<br/>after seeing the scores thread with so many people wondering why their scores are so low, i decided that i was going to try to comment on either the ''true to form because'' or ''i dont think it fits because'' aspect on these images for the sake of people wondering "what are voters thinking", and "abandoned" is a general enough concept, but it really does have a connotation of value attached to it.<br/>Based on your description, I get why you picked this shot, but wonder if maybe the bigger house with the newspaper still in scene wouldn''t have resonated better with the community. I''d love to see some of your outtakes if you had any of the houses</td>', 'sorry for being the voice of the nay-sayers in this case. :(after seeing the scores thread with so many people wondering why their scores are so low, i decided that i was going to try to comment on either the ''true to form because'' or ''i dont think it fits because'' aspect on these images for the sake of people wondering "what are voters thinking", and "abandoned" is a general enough concept, but it really does have a connotation of value attached to it.Based on your description, I get why you picked this shot, but wonder if maybe the bigger house with the newspaper still in scene wouldn''t have resonated better with the community. I''d love to see some of your outtakes if you had any of the houses', '2012-06-25 12:56:10.000000', NULL, 0),
