(6802220, 1021259, 112539, '<td valign="top">Did question if I should make it B&amp;W to make it look more abandoned. Also, looking at other shots I took, it might have been better represented from the farther away shot that showed more of the old wood on the barn. Just wanted to make sure people could see what it was. Always good to get feed back. That is how we get better. Thanks Ryan</td>', 'Did question if I should make it B&W to make it look more abandoned. Also, looking at other shots I took, it might have been better represented from the farther away shot that showed more of the old wood on the barn. Just wanted to make sure people could see what it was. Always good to get feed back. That is how we get better. Thanks Ryan', '2012-06-26 09:19:43.000000', NULL, 0),
